IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `gia-guardianship`

-- Guardianship of Infants Act 1934, ss 3 to 8, 11, 11A, 16 to 18 and 21 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_guardianship-of-infants-act-1934.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `ss 3, 4 and 5`

#ASSERT `may apply under s 5 for custody, access or maintenance` `the father`
#ASSERT `may apply under s 5 for custody, access or maintenance` `the mother`
#ASSERT `may apply under s 5 for custody, access or maintenance` `a guardian appointed under this Act`
#ASSERT NOT `may apply under s 5 for custody, access or maintenance` `a grandparent`
#ASSERT NOT `may apply under s 5 for custody, access or maintenance` `the infant`

