#ASSERT `the maximum fine for the breaches` 3 EQUALS 60000

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months for the breaches` 1 EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months for the breaches` 2 EQUALS 24

